*** Keywords ***
General_SiSo_Auto_DL_Test_Model_Activation
    [Documentation]
    ...  Activates NR Downlink Test Model using selenium. Version for TDD and FDD radios.
    ...
    ...  :param str test_model: (Mandatory) One of following NR DL test models supported for cell configuration:
    ...                                     "TM1.1", "TM1.2",
    ...                                     "TM2", "TM2A",
    ...                                     "TM3.1", "TM3.1A", "TM3.2", "TM3.3",
    ...                                     "TM1.1_ETSI", "IdleActive"
    ...                               It's possible to run many test models at once on tested cell by giving argument test_model as list of strings.
    ...                               In Robot Framework structure it's required to create list before starting Test Case, then pass the list
    ...                               as test_model parameter, e.g. :
    ...                               @{test_models}=         Create List                    NR-FR1-TM1.1  NR-FR1-TM1.2 NR-FR1-TM3.1
    ...                               General_SiSo_Auto_DL_Test_Model_Activation             test_model=@{test_models}
    ...                               WARNING: Models "TM1.1_ETSI" and "IdleActive" are only available after entering R&D mode beforehand.
    ...  :param int cell_id: (Mandatory) : Global cell id of tested NR cell.
    ...  :param int beam_id: (Optional) : parameter beamPatternId, range <0 to 1200>, default 1.
    ...  :param str polarization: (Optional) : One of following: "P_plus45_or_0", "P_minus45_or_90", "P_both", default "P_both".
    ...  :param int result_collection_time: (Optional) : sleep timeout (in seconds) for test result collection, default 30.
    ...  :param str text_for_test: (Optional) : some message used in test result data, default "lorem ipsum".
    ...  :param float/None pmax: (Optional) : pmax parameter, range <0 to 60 step=0.1>, if None, pmax will be read from current SCF configuration on BTS,
    ...                                       default None
    ...  :param int power_backoff: (Optional) : powerBackoff parameter, range <0 to 490>, default None means default WebEM value will not be changed.
    ...  :param str type_of_load: (Optional) : loadType parameter, one of following: "flatLoad", "burstLoad", "slotWiseLoad",
    ...                                        default None means default WebEM value will not be changed.
    ...  :param str level_of_load_flat: (Optional) : loadLevelFlat parameter, one of following: "low", "medium", "busy", "full",
    ...                                              default None means default WebEM value will not be changed.
    ...  :param str level_of_load_burst: (Optional) : loadLevelBurst parameter, one of following: burst_13_5", "burst_19_2", "burst_32_7", "burst_46_2",
    ...                                               "burst_59_6", "burst_73_1", "burst_86_5", "burst_100",
    ...                                               default None means default WebEM value will not be changed.
    ...  :param str spec_ssb_beam_pattern: (Optional) : numOfSsbBeamPatternId parameter, one of following: "ssb_4", "ssb_8", "ssb_32",
    ...                                                 default None means default WebEM value will not be changed.
    ...  :param int timeout: (Optional) : timeout (in seconds) for test model startup and termination, default 30.
    ...  :param str level_of_load_slot_wise: (Optional) : loadLevelSlotWise parameter, one of following: "load_0_low", "load_10", "load_30_medium",
    ...                                                   "load_50_busy_hour", "load_70",
    ...                                                   default None means default WebEM value will not be changed.

    [Arguments]                                             ${test_model}
    ...                                                     ${cell_id}
    ...                                                     ${beam_id}=1
    ...                                                     ${polarization}=P_both
    ...                                                     ${result_collection_time}=30
    ...                                                     ${text_for_test}=lorem ipsum
    ...                                                     ${pmax}=${None}
    ...                                                     ${power_backoff}=${None}
    ...                                                     ${type_of_load}=${None}
    ...                                                     ${level_of_load_flat}=${None}
    ...                                                     ${level_of_load_burst}=${None}
    ...                                                     ${spec_ssb_beam_pattern}=${None}
    ...                                                     ${timeout}=30
    ...                                                     ${level_of_load_slot_wise}=${None}

    [Timeout]                                               24 hours

    Create admin session with default alias
    ${connection}                                           connections.get_default_admin_connection_alias
    ${webui_obj}                                            Create Selenium Session
    ...                                                     admin_connection=${connection}
    ...                                                     download_dir=${logs_path}

    ${cells_params}                                         tm_setup_adm.get_cell_parameters_required_to_setup_test_model
    ...                                                     cell_id=${cell_id}
    ...                                                     connection=${connection}
    ${test_pmax}                                            Get Pmax For Test Module Activation
    ...                                                     cell_id=${cell_id}
    ...                                                     pmax=${pmax}
    ...                                                     download_dir=/tmp
    ...                                                     connection=${connection}
    ${local_cell}                                           scf.get_correct_local_cell_name
    ...                                                     cell_id=${cell_id}
    ...                                                     connection=${connection}
    &{nrarfcn}                                              tm_setup_adm.get_nrafcn_variables_for_nr_cell_id
    ...                                                     cell_id=${cell_id}
    ...                                                     connection=${connection}

    Remove All Test Modules Result Files                    download_dir=${logs_path}
    @{test_models_list}                                     tm_startup.create_test_models_list
    ...                                                     test_model=${test_model}
    FOR    ${tm_index}    ${tm_element}    IN ENUMERATE    @{test_models_list}
        ${test_id}                             Evaluate     ${tm_index} + 1
        Start Downlink Test                                 test_id=${test_id}
        ...                                                 test_model=${tm_element}
        ...                                                 local_cell=${local_cell}
        ...                                                 physical_cell_id=${cells_params["phy_cellid"]}
        ...                                                 polarization=${polarization}
        ...                                                 beam_id=${beam_id}
        ...                                                 p_max=${test_pmax}
        ...                                                 power_backoff=${power_backoff}
        ...                                                 type_of_load=${type_of_load}
        ...                                                 level_of_load_flat=${level_of_load_flat}
        ...                                                 level_of_load_burst=${level_of_load_burst}
        ...                                                 spec_ssb_beam_pattern=${spec_ssb_beam_pattern}
        ...                                                 timeout=${timeout}
        ...                                                 level_of_load_slot_wise=${level_of_load_slot_wise}
        ...                                                 &{nrarfcn}
        ${center_freq}                                      Get Downlink Carrier Frequency
        ...                                                 webui_obj=${webui_obj}
        ...                                                 nr_cell=${cell_id}
        sleep                                               ${result_collection_time}s  reason=Collect Test Module Result
        ${result_file_path}                                 Stop Downlink Test Module And Save Results
        ...                                                 test_id=${test_id}
        ...                                                 text_for_test=${text_for_test}
        ...                                                 download_dir=${logs_path}
        ...                                                 nr_cell=${cell_id}
        ...                                                 connection=${connection}
        ...                                                 timeout=${timeout}
    END
    Check Content Of Test Results And Refresh Page          text_for_test=${text_for_test}
    ...                                                     result_file_path=${result_file_path}
    Check Unavailability Of Downlink Test Module            nr_cell=${cell_id}
    ...                                                     test_model=${test_model}

    [Teardown]                                              Downlink Test Activation Teardown
